11
00:47:57,600 --> 00:48:03,600
Venom: The Last Dance is a 2024 American superhero film
based on the Marvel Comics character Venom.

12
00:52:19,200 --> 00:52:25,200
It is the sequel to Venom (2018) and Venom: Let There Be Carnage (2021),
and the fifth film in Sony's Spider-Man Universe (SSU).

13
00:56:40,800 --> 00:56:46,800
Written and directed by Kelly Marcel, it stars Tom Hardy as Eddie Brock and Venom, alongside
Chiwetel Ejiofor, Juno Temple, Rhys Ifans, Stephen Graham, Peggy Lu, and Alanna Ubach.

14
01:01:02,400 --> 01:01:08,400
In the film, Eddie and Venom are on the run from both of their worlds.

15
01:05:24,000 --> 01:05:30,000
Hardy revealed in August 2018 that he was signed on to appear in a third Venom film and Sony
Pictures began development by December 2021 after the second film was released.

16
01:09:45,600 --> 01:09:51,600
Marcel and Hardy were writing the script by June 2022, and Marcel was set
to make her directorial debut with the film that October.

17
01:14:07,200 --> 01:14:13,200
New cast members, including Ejiofor and Temple, joined in mid-2023
and filming began at the end of June 2023 in Spain.

18
01:18:28,800 --> 01:18:34,800
Production was halted the next month due to the 2023 SAG-AFTRA
strike, and resumed that November after the strike ended.

19
01:22:50,400 --> 01:22:56,400
The film was completed by the end of February 2024 and
its title was revealed a month later.

20
01:27:12,000 --> 01:27:18,000
Venom: The Last Dance premiered at the Regal Times Square theater in New York City on
October 21, 2024, and was released in the United States on October 25.

21
01:31:33,600 --> 01:31:39,600
The film received mixed reviews from critics, with
some praising Hardy's performance.

22
01:35:55,200 --> 01:36:01,200
Despite being the lowest-grossing film in the trilogy, it was still a
box-office success, grossing $478.9 million worldwide.

23
01:40:16,800 --> 01:40:22,800
The film explores themes of hero, superhero, anti
hero, villain, alien life-form.

24
01:44:38,400 --> 01:44:44,400
The tone is thought_provoking.
